content.p:
refused Mr Tree’s application pursuant to Rule 5(3)(j) of The Tribunal Procedure (First-tier Tribunal) (Tax Chamber) Rules 2009 (“the Rules”

 and references to a “Rule” are to be construed accordingly.
		  ) for a stay and/or pursuant to Rule 8(3)(c) and 8(7)(a) for a direction barring the Respondents from taking further part in proceedings on the ground that issuing the DLN was an abuse of process of the Tribunal; and
